 "text": "40 miles of paved trail connecting seven towns in northwest Arkansas. You can ride from Fayetteville to Bentonville, mostly off the road. It starts at mile zero on Kessler Mountain and runs north to Bella Vista, about six miles from Missouri. Twice a year, thousands of people ride at square to square, downtown to downtown. Have a slow Sunday.",
